{
  "hash": 2272984664,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Grenade Ability Damage grants Melee Energy once per Damage Instance.\n\n'Damage Over Time' grenades only provide Melee Energy once per damage tick regardless of the number of enemies damaged. Other grenades only grant Melee Energy once per submunition.\n\nMelee Energy granted per Damage Instance:\n• 3%: Void Spike, Void Wall, Scatter Grenade, and Vortex Grenade\n• 8%: Axion Bolt, Suppressor Grenade, and Magnetic Grenade (including when used with the <void/>Chaos Accelerant aspect)\n\nDoes not work with <void/>Unbreakable.\n\n#ChunkEnergyScalars",
      "updatedAt": "2025-08-23T20:44:14.399Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
